.env
# The installers write ``.env.backup`` / ``orion.toml.backup`` next to the
# live files before ``--force`` rewrites them.  A bare ``.env`` rule does not
# cover those names, so a plaintext copy of every secret would become
# committable (see ORION_AUDIT_2026-02.md, "Fuite d'identifiants").
.env.*
!.env.example
*.backup
*.backup.*
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
data/
.workflow
tests/
!tests/
